        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-23T15:40:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since there are tests that run in parallel, we could see a flaky failure where `PurgeResourceCache()` correctly did nothing but another test created the image filter cache before the call to `Get()`.\n\nI can\u0027t think of a great way to work around that since there\u0027s no good way to expose the mutex to prevent such interleaved work. Right now DM doesn\u0027t have a way to mark a CPU test as needing to run in serial, it does them all in parallel.\n\nIt looks like it\u0027ll be pretty easy to add support for serially-run CPU test cases and that should address this issue. I\u0027ll work that up quick.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 343,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 344,
        "endChar": 56
      },
